Receiver: the idle release is a setting, 5 min by default, 0 turns it off (2026-10-13).

Releasing a wireless session nobody watches keeps an iPhone near a box left on cool, but a page opened again
afterwards waits about 7 s for the picture. That trade-off is the owner's: CARPLAY_IDLE_RELEASE_SECONDS sets the
wait (run-receiver.py --idle-release; OpenWrt uci dashplay.main.idle_release and the LuCI page; OneCloud and
N1 state/options.json), 0 never releases. The default is 5 minutes (user's choice), not 2.

